			]
			description: [
				"&6&lYou designed a power plant rather than placing one.&r"
				""
				"&7Advanced Generators is the odd one out among this pack's power mods - it has no tier ladder to climb, just a box you make as big as you need and a set of modules to fit. Two players' builds will not look alike.&r"
				""
				"&8Between this, Powah, Solar Flux, Mekanism turbines and Create alternators, there are five completely different ways to power this base. None of them is wrong."
			]
